+# Domain glossary
+
+Revision 1 — 2026-10-02. This page owns provisional domain meanings for the trial.
+The [model](../database/model.md) owns relationships and unresolved decisions.
+
+- **Organisation:** an identifiable organisation whose involvement in agreements
+  can be retrieved. Its name is a label, not its identity. No legal form or
+  universal participant capacity is assumed.
+- **Agreement:** an identifiable agreement connecting the involvement and coverage
+  facts needed by the brief. Its legal effect and lifecycle are unresolved.
+- **Service:** the identifiable subject an agreement covers. Its granularity and
+  classification are not supplied.
+- **Involvement:** the association through which an organisation is found for an
+  agreement. Which capacities qualify remains open; this term does not imply
+  ownership or permission.
+- **Participant role:** the capacity of an organisation in a particular agreement.
+  The trial leaves the vocabulary and permitted combinations undecided; it does
+  not introduce a role table.
+- **Coverage:** the association from an agreement to its service subject. Its
+  cardinality is an explicit model assumption, not part of this definition.
